# Public URL of the deployed site, for example https://your-domain.com (a trailing slash is fine).
# vite.config.ts fills it into index.html at build time: the canonical link, og:url, og:image,
# twitter:image and the JSON-LD "url". Set it in your host's build environment or in
# .env.production.local; values from the environment override this file.
#
# Left empty here on purpose. When it is empty, the production URL that Vercel or Netlify exposes is used
# if the build runs there; otherwise those tags are left out of the HTML and the build prints a warning.
VITE_SITE_URL=
